SYNTHESIS
  This directly enumerates 2^h_n grid-symmetric tilings by crossing layers.
  It avoids the full 2^F_n filter when the target is the self-converse half cube.
  It does not yet solve the full complement quotient; that needs unordered
  pair states for nonfixed mirror-cell orbits.
